  "question": {
    "text": "Two bodies of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> are moving with equal kinetic energies. The ratio of magnitude of their linear momentum is :"
